    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level1.Description::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level1.Description",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "Navigate carefully through the\ngates. You have [[8.5 minutes]] \nto finish the course. If you\nget too far off track you\nmay press [[H]] to abort this\nrun. Each missed gate incurs\na [[15 second]] time penalty.",
      "target_zh_TW": "小心穿越各道\n閘門。你有 [[8.5 分鐘]]\n完成賽道。如果\n偏離航道太遠，\n可按 [[H]] 中止這次\n挑戰。每錯過一道閘門\n會被罰時 [[15 秒]]。",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level1.Description",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level2.Title::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level2.Title",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "Level Two",
      "target_zh_TW": "第二關",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level2.Title",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level2.Description::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level2.Description",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "On this level you have\n[[6 minutes]] to complete the \ncourse. For each target you \ndestroy you receive a \n[[2 second]] time bonus. \nLearn to configure your\nshields for greater safety.",
      "target_zh_TW": "本關你有\n[[6 分鐘]]完成\n賽道。每摧毀\n一個目標，可獲得\n[[2 秒]]的時間獎勵。\n學會調配你的\n護盾，以策安全。",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level2.Description",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level3.Title::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level3.Title",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "Level Three",
      "target_zh_TW": "第三關",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level3.Title",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level3.Description::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level3.Description",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "On this level you have a time\nlimit of [[4.5 minutes]]. The\ncourse is more [[difficult]] and \nthere are more targets.\nDestroy as many [[targets]] as\nyou can to increase your \ntime limit.",
      "target_zh_TW": "本關的時間\n限制為 [[4.5 分鐘]]。\n賽道更加[[困難]]，\n目標也更多。\n盡量多摧毀[[目標]]，\n藉此延長你的\n時間限制。",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level3.Description",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level4.Title::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level4.Title",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "Level Four",
      "target_zh_TW": "第四關",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level4.Title",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level4.Description::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level4.Description",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "On this level you have only \n[[3 minutes]] to complete the\ncourse. Reconfigure your \npower system to gain [[extra]]\nspeed. Nearly every panel has\na [[full complement]] of targets.\nCan you destroy them all?",
      "target_zh_TW": "本關你只有\n[[3 分鐘]]完成\n賽道。重新調配你的\n動力系統以獲得[[額外]]\n速度。幾乎每塊面板都\n[[佈滿]]了目標。\n你能全部摧毀嗎？",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level4.Description",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level5.Title::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level5.Title",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "Level Five",
      "target_zh_TW": "第五關",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level5.Title",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level5.Description::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level5.Description",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "Keep a careful balance between\nspeed and shields.  You have\n[[5.5 minutes]] to complete\nthe course.\nComplete this level to earn a\npromotion to [[flight officer]].",
      "target_zh_TW": "在速度與護盾之間\n謹慎取得平衡。你有\n[[5.5 分鐘]]完成\n賽道。\n完成本關即可\n晉升為[[飛行准尉]]。",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level5.Description",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level6.Title::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level6.Title",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "Level Six",
      "target_zh_TW": "第六關",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level6.Title",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level6.Description::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level6.Description",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "On this level the course is\nmore [[difficult[[ and there\nare more targets.\nConfigure your shields to full\npower forward.\nYou have [[5 minutes]] to \ncomplete this level.",
      "target_zh_TW": "本關賽道\n更加[[困難[[，\n目標也更多。\n將護盾調整為\n全力集中前方。\n你有 [[5 分鐘]]\n完成本關。",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level6.Description",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level7.Title::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level7.Title",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "Level Seven",
      "target_zh_TW": "第七關",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level7.Title",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level7.Description::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level7.Description",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "On this level all platforms are\n[[fully]] loaded with firing\ntargets. If you have time try \nto find a [[safe]] place to slow\ndown and recharge your \nshields. You have [[5 minutes]]\nto complete this level.",
      "target_zh_TW": "本關所有平台都\n[[滿載]]會開火的\n目標。有時間的話，\n找個[[安全]]的地方減速，\n為你的\n護盾充能。你有 [[5 分鐘]]\n完成本關。",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level7.Description",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level8.Title::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level8.Title",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "Level Eight",
      "target_zh_TW": "第八關",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level8.Title",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg.xliff::XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings::Mission.level8.Description::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings",
      "unit_id": "Mission.level8.Description",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "This is the [[most]] difficult\ncourse. Some panels are set \nup to shoot at you from \nbehind. You have a [[4.5 minute]] \ntime limit. Complete this level \nto earn your [[flight badge]].\n[[May the Force be with you.]]",
      "target_zh_TW": "這是[[最]]困難的\n賽道。部分面板\n會從你背後\n開火。時間限制為 [[4.5 分鐘]]。\n完成本關即可\n獲得[[飛行徽章]]。\n[[願原力與你同在。]]",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.xwing.OriginalStrings.ppg / Mission.level8.Description",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    }
  ]
}
